{
  "description": "MerLin adaptation, non-distributed reference: the photonic circuit of photonic_accuracy_original trained with QuClassi's released settings (sequential update, shift pi/(2 sqrt(epoch+1)), weights in [0, 2 pi)), locally, 25 epochs, exact probabilities, same data.",
